{"version":1,"content":"<p>獵戶座流星雨近日在黑龍江上空閃耀。</p><p>流星雨大多源自彗星，獵戶座流星雨母體就是哈雷彗星。</p><p>獵戶座流星雨活躍期幾乎貫穿整個10月，而極大期集中在10月21日至22日。</p><p>獵戶座流星雨特點比較鮮明：流星速度快、亮度高且尾迹明顯，偶爾還會出現明亮的火流星。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:21:50.840845+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T00:46:20.112699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:39.645206+00:00","content_hash":"067e5bed244dca7da5f738151fe20521de783295e7dfcf7e493fd7a4bdb6cf74","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}